'' -appicon IS A .png (docs/tiko-android A6): aapt2 compiles it as mipmap/ic_launcher. Anything else
'' is refused before anything compiles.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -app -target android-x86_64 -appicon tests/source/plain.bas tests/source/plain.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 2
'' EXPECT-OUT: TKO0197: '-appicon tests/source/plain.bas': not a .png file
